---
import AppDocs from '../../../layouts/AppDocs.astro';
import { stampShift, supportEmail } from '../../../data/apps';
---
<AppDocs app={stampShift} active="overview" title="Stamp Shift" description="How Stamp Shift works, what Extra Routes includes, and where to find support and privacy information." heading="Stamp Shift." intro="Three piles. One perfect order. Match the sun, leaf and moon stamps to the delivery order.">
  <section><h2>A small sorting puzzle</h2><p>Send a stamp from the front of a pile when it matches the next stamp in the delivery order. Use Stash to keep one blocking stamp in the Drawer for later. Its single slot is reusable after you Send the stashed stamp. Use Flip to turn one pile around, once per route.</p><p>Start with 30 free routes, including three short, replayable lessons. Open Learn on the home screen to practice, or Routes to explore the puzzles. Undo, Restart and three-stage hints are always free. There are no timers, lives, ads or in-app accounts.</p><div class="docs-actions"><a href="/apps/stamp-shift/support">Get help with Stamp Shift</a><a href="/apps/stamp-shift/privacy">Read the privacy policy</a></div></section>
  <section><h2>Extra Routes</h2><p>Explore 300 routes in total: 30 free routes and 270 additional routes unlocked with one permanent in-app purchase. There is no subscription. Apple's current localized price appears in the app before purchase.</p><p>To restore, open Routes on the home screen and select a route marked Paid, then choose Restore purchases in The post shop using the Apple Account that bought the pack.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Made by Jordan Blum</h2><p>Progress and settings stay on your device. Apple handles purchases. You choose whether to share puzzle information when asking for help.</p><p class="docs-contact">Support: <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}?subject=Stamp%20Shift%20support`}>{supportEmail}</a>.</p></section>
</AppDocs>
